{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/items/503348/", "pk": 503348, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/", "pk": 105484, "shortname": "sailsandiego", "name": "Sail San Diego", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Private Sunset Sail", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 6, "unicode": "Private Sunset Sail", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1405, "description": "#Private Sunset Sail\nSail into the beauty of a San Diego Sunset. Cruise along the coastline, feel the breeze, and witness the sky transform with vibrant colors. Our Sunset Sail offers a memorable and relaxing experience, perfect for a romantic evening or a peaceful escape.\n\n##Duration \n3 Hours \nOur departure times are adjusted to seasonal sunset patterns.\n\n\n**Bareboat Charter Info:** Following current Coast Guard regulations, your Bareboat Charter doesn't include a Captain. But don't worry, we have a list of skilled Licensed Captains familiar with our program and boats. Captains on our roster charge $75 an hour, plus tips, payable directly to them after the trip.\n\nIf you've picked a bareboat charter, after you book, a friendly crew member will get in touch with you and share a list of captains for you to pick from.\n##About\nThis private Sunset Sailing experience for just you and your friends, family or guests.\n\n##More Info\n- All beer, non-alcoholic drinks and snacks are complimentary. We don’t give you just one and have you pay for more!\n- 1–6 guests max (Captain Included) or 7–12 guests max (Bareboat).", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Shelter Island", "booking_notes": "**Please Note:** If you booked a Private Bareboat Charter (over 6 guests), a Captain's Fee of $50 per hour is due directly to the captain after your trip. This fee is calculated based on the hours the captain is onboard and is separate from your boat rental.\n\nGratuity is always at your discretion, though our captains certainly appreciate it for great service. If you'd like to leave a tip,15-20% of the boat rental is customary. The Captain's Fee and gratuity can be paid via cash, or Venmo. ~Thank you! \n\n[View our Current Captain Roster](https://sailsandiego.com/about-us/)\n\n---\t\n**We genuinely care about your overall experience from start to finish so please continue reading all the information below:**\n\n**BEFORE ARRIVAL:**\nPlease have every guest sign our sailing waiver prior to your arrival. The waivers are all digital so no need to print anything out. Don't stress if you're having too much difficulty with them, as you can always sign when checking in at our office location.\n\n**CHECK-IN:**\nPlease check in at our office 20-30 minutes before the departure time. A physical boarding pass will be required to board your assigned sailboat. Your boarding pass will be provided at our Sail San Diego office, located at 2720 Shelter Island Drive, San Diego, California 92106.\n\nYou will find us on the corner of the first floor across the street from the Brigantine Restaurant and next to All Aboard. \n\nAfter receiving your boarding pass, you will be directed to our private marina for boarding. We will open gates 10 minutes prior to the departure time.\n\n**PARKING:**\nSan Diego hosts 32 million visitors annually, making parking especially limited during summer. We recommend arriving at least 30 minutes early to find parking or using Lyft.\n\nIf using Uber, please ensure you enter our address directly. Do not enter \"Sail San Diego,\" as this will direct the driver to our old location from eight years ago, which is about half a mile away.\n\n[CLICK HERE TO VIEW OUR DIRECTIONS PAGE](https://sailsandiego.com/contact/)\n\n**PROHIBITED ITEMS:**\nNO SMOKING, HARD ALCOHOL OR RED WINE.\n\nFeel free to bring outside beverages and snacks, but remember you're on a sailboat. Hand-held foods are recommended.\n\nWe are a federally regulated business and drugs are strictly prohibited (including Marijuana) while underway or at the marina. Vessel will return to the dock and Harbor Police will be called if the Captain sees or smells Marijuana. **NO EXCEPTIONS!**\n\nFrom your Captains and Crew at Sail San Diego,\n\nFair Winds and Following Seas", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "3 Hour Sail • Most Popular • Likely to Sell Out!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/items/503348/images/1338246/", "pk": 1338246, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/TnfJlyJ9SaKH74FJUEhh", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/TnfJlyJ9SaKH74FJUEhh", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sailsandiego/items/503348/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/TnfJlyJ9SaKH74FJUEhh", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/TnfJlyJ9SaKH74FJUEhh", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Imag